  home.php:4-9 — the <title> IS row 70 (`siteTitle`), verbatim, no
  "SilverGames.com —" prefix (row 70's own text already names the site,
  e.g. en "The Best Online Games - Silvergames.com").

  THE HOMEPAGE HAS NO <h1>, and that is production's own shape: `home.html`
  opens on `#HPSwipe`, so the hero slider is the first thing under the header.
  This port used to print row 70 a second time as a heading — a visible
  "THE BEST ONLINE GAMES - SILVERGAMES.COM" bar between the nav and the slider
  that production has never shown. (It replaced an earlier invented English-only
  `tagline`; the fix for that was to drop the heading, not to relocalise it.)
  Every other page type still carries its own <h1>.
